lly  conceived of so me and Jason Anderson  the other the third guy who was in Troy  go with me and Tim started rewriting a  lot of the dialogue in the game that's  kind of when I rediscovered my passion  for writing I think I think I just think  about over the years I just think more  about the process and more about what  I'm trying to accomplish back then and  even still an Arcanum it was kind of  just free willing just whatever came to  mind whatever I'm going to do not really  kind of like stepping back and looking  at it and it I've been doing much more  directing and editing and you know  helping other writers kind of like get  what we want for the game as opposed to  doing a lot of the writing myself which  was you know and fall out in Arcanum I  was doing a lion's share of that stuff  well I'm afraid we're out of time thank  you so much for joining us when can  people play the artworks I'm sorry when  can people be playing yeah so October  25th it's not that long to wait thank  you and if you're joining us at home  make sure you don't go anywhere we'll be  right back with Marvel Ultimate Alliance  3  you
 

